%% State machine: lifecycle of a store event from issuance to completion.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : scheduler emits store_event_idx
    Pending --> InFlight : worker dequeues and launch_copy
    InFlight --> Completed : torch.Event done and hash inserted into tier cache
    Completed --> Reported : worker reports via SimpleCPUOffloadWorkerMetadata
    Reported --> [*] : scheduler accumulates across world_size and frees pending refs

    InFlight --> Failed : resiliency RFC - timeout or DMA error
    Failed --> Quarantined : tier health goes suspect to quarantined
    Quarantined --> [*]
